msgid "What you type in the command palette, the player's command list (names, menus, keys and whether each is on or available) and the playback state (playing or paused, position, duration, speed) go to this provider with your API key, as in the chat. File names, playlists, history, track and chapter titles and subtitles are not sent. The provider charges your account."
